THREE WEEKS have passed since University of Texas at E] Paso baseball coach Andy Cohen announced his resignation, but his office remains the
same. 
Every morning, dedicated Andy drives his UTEP/colored,orange/and/white Buick to the Special Events Center. When he arrives, as 
